<title>USA: MFRI Inc Q3 net rises, sales fall.</title>
<headline>MFRI Inc Q3 net rises, sales fall.</headline>
<dateline>NILES, Ill. 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months		 Nine Months</p>
<p>		     10/31/96    10/31/95    10/31/96    10/31/95</p>
<p> Net sales    $25,326,000 $25,883,000 $70,281,000 $65,762,000</p>
